<title>CHINA: Cash or stake in China Telecom for HK Telecom - C&amp;W.</title>
<headline>Cash or stake in China Telecom for HK Telecom - C&amp;W.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable &amp; Wireless Plc said on Friday it would consider selling further shares in Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd to China Telecom (Hong Kong) Ltd for either cash or equity in China Telecom.  </p>
<p>&quot;It could be in cash but we've expressed an interest in being an equity partner in China Telecom (Hong Kong),&quot; C&amp;W chief executive Richard Brown told reporters after Hongkong Telecom's annual meeting in Hong Kong.</p>
</text>
